Amulets of lifesaving are triggered when the wearer dies.  Polymorphing
into an undead monster is not considered dying, however (what would the
effects of being saved be?).

Undead monsters, however, are already dead and thus don't trigger
lifesaving when they're destroyed.  Note which verb I'm using.

Wizard mode:
^W uncursed amulet of life saving
^W uncursed wand of polymorph (0:10)
#monpolycontrol
^G orc
t (amulet of life saving) (direction of orc)
(step back)
  The orc picks up an uncursed amulet of life saving.
  The orc puts on an uncursed amulet of life saving.
z (wand of polymorph) (direction of orc)

And then hope to pete he doesn't do what he did to me, which is shudder
and die.  Oops.  After setting it up again:

